	(text "12 V bus only: the gate drive is Vin, so Vgs(on) = -(Vin - ~0.7 V).\nDMP6023LE Vgs max is +/-20 V: do not feed this stage from a 24 V bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 53.34 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ddff57b-48e6-4645-b29e-8aadf70deeda")
	)
	(text "D9 high = Q1 on (non-inverting). At reset D9 floats: R3 holds Q3 off,\nR4 pulls the Q4/Q5 bases to +12 V and Q4 holds the gate at the source."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 53.34 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dd1c4860-753b-47c6-96bd-feb9efd900b9")
	)
	(text "Layout: Q1 source, C6 and D2 anode in one tight loop.\nDriver returns (Q3, Q5, R3) go to GNDPWR beside Q1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 53.34 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f6abab57-2a58-49df-9d55-5c444375b065")
	)
	(text "A0 sense: 20.0k/10.0k, 12 V out = 4.00 V at A0.\nR8 and C8 return to GND at the Nano; sense Vout at J2.1.\nR9 bleed keeps low output voltages regulable at no load (12 mA at 12 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
